{"user": "Explain why", "user_ts": "2026-08-18T21:58:54.947730+00:00", "assistant": "Because **c8 is a \u201cquiet\u201d endgame move**:\n\n- It flips only **d8**, so it doesn\u2019t give White lots of new counter-flips.\n- It strengthens the bottom edge while **not playing next to the empty h1 corner**.\n- By contrast, **g2** flips more now, but it makes **h1** easier for White to take; a corner like **h1** is permanent and can swing the final count.\n\nSo **c8** is better because it preserves the best final disc count, not because it wins the most discs immediately.", "assistant_started_ts": "2026-08-18T21:59:12.163866+00:00", "assistant_ts": "2026-08-18T21:59:14.011398+00:00", "annotation_user": {"final": ["Knowledge Deficit Question"], "consensus": ["Knowledge Deficit Question"], "votes": {"Solution Request": 1, "Knowledge Deficit Question": 2}, "confidence": {"Solution Request": 0.3333333333333333, "Knowledge Deficit Question": 0.6666666666666666}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Solution Request"], "sonnet": ["Knowledge Deficit Question"], "llama": ["Knowledge Deficit Question"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant_fine": {"final": ["Move Verdict", "Local Justification", "General Principle"], "consensus": ["Move Verdict", "Local Justification", "General Principle"], "votes": {"Move Verdict": 2, "Local Justification": 3, "General Principle": 3}, "confidence": {"Move Verdict": 0.6666666666666666, "Local Justification": 1.0, "General Principle": 1.0}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Move Verdict", "Local Justification", "General Principle"], "sonnet": ["Local Justification", "General Principle"], "llama": ["Move Verdict", "Local Justification", "General Principle"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false, "coarse": ["Provide Correct Answer", "Direct Instruction"]}}
